    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"2\">Level 2 - Beginner</span><span class=\"time\">15 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip ok\">Easy</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Monotonic stack</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Hash map</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/next-greater-element-i/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 496</a>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Next Greater Element I</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Scan <code>nums2</code> once with a stack that stays decreasing. When a value <code>x</code> arrives and pops smaller values, <code>x</code> is the next greater element of every value it pops; store that in a map and answer each <code>nums1</code> query in O(1). O(n + m) time, the template for every \"next greater\" problem.</p>\n"
